<section class="service">
    <h1>Travel</h1>
    <div class="service-text">
        <p>Travel photography is my way of exploring and understanding the world. Through landscapes, people and everyday life,
            I capture not only how a place looks, but also how it feels. I’m drawn to the stories, encounters and details that
            reveal the character of a destination and the connection between those who live there and those who pass through. The
            result is a collection of images that goes beyond documentation, conveying atmosphere, emotion and a genuine sense of
            place.
        </p>
        <p>I’m also interested in documenting journeys from the inside, focusing on the people who experience them. Beyond the
            destinations themselves, I look for the experiences, relationships and moments that make every trip unique.</p>
    </div>
</section>
